<title>USA: Hudson Technologies Inc Q3 $0.05 vs $0.07.</title>
<headline>Hudson Technologies Inc Q3 $0.05 vs $0.07.</headline>
<dateline>HILLBURN, N.Y. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three month		Nine month</p>
<p>				period ended	    period ended</p>
<p>				 Sept. 30,		  Sept. 30,</p>
<p> Unaudited		   1996     1995	  1996	1995</p>
<p> Revenues		  $5,919   $3,839	$15,126   $19,777</p>
<p> Gross Profit	     2,746    1,704	  6,689     7,152</p>
<p>Total operating expenses</p>
<p>				2,395    1,335	  7,280     4,098</p>
